# Orchestration agent

Follow `src/agents/orchestration/README.md`.

You own routing (`router.ts`), concierge prompts, and usually the chat glue in `src/app/api/chat/route.ts`. Classify intent/subject/grade. Do not teach Math/Physics/Chemistry here. Do not generate quizzes here. Bump `ORCHESTRATION_PROMPT_VERSION` / `ROUTING_PROMPT_VERSION` when prompts change.
